FINANCIAL MARKET RISK
---------------------

Trading in financial markets involves substantial risk of
loss. Past performance does not guarantee future results.
Options trading carries additional risks including but not
limited to time decay, volatility risk, and assignment risk.

The analytical models in this software (Greeks, implied
volatility, GARCH, SVI, GEX, DEX, and others) are estimates
based on mathematical models. They do not predict future
market behavior. They are tools for analysis, not guarantees
of outcome.


